## User Specified Lessons


## User Specified Lessons

- Convert the report **section by section** into real React/HTML (live text, CSS boxes, coded charts). Never dump the whole 1920×14400 page as one screenshot, one SVG, or one generated HTML file. The site can still be one SPA — each chapter is its own component, assembled in App.
- Wireframe the page first (empty labeled section frames). Fill one slot at a time. Layout is document flow with `max-width: 1920px`, not `transform: scale` of a 1920×14400 canvas — otherwise it cannot go responsive.
- Do not batch the conversion into 2 phases (desktop then mobile). Work is ~20 separate phases: one visual section per phase, overlay-accepted before the next starts. Fat chapters (Users, Products, War channel) still get sub-crops inside their phase — never code 3000–4500px in one sitting.
- Keep every fact, number, caption, SVG, and chart from the Figma/PDF sources. Reconstruct broken PDF-import Persian (گیلن → گیلان, در۴۰۴۱ → در ۱۴۰۴) without dropping content.
- Brand color is Figma `#EC078D` (not the green MASTER palette from ui-ux-pro-max).
- Figma MCP Starter plan is rate-limited this month; use local PDF + cached dump + `public/assets/figma-war`.

## Cursor learned

- Vite create-vite cancels in a non-empty folder (PDFs/.fig present); scaffold files manually.
- Basket depth: decode `chart omgh kharid.svg` into live HTML rows (gray ۱۴۰۳ + pink ۱۴۰۴ bars, growth pill) — user rejected dropping in the whole SVG as `<img>`.
- Illustrator SVGs with `<style>` classes (`.st0` etc.) render **blank** via `<img src>` — flatten to inline `fill`/`stroke` before putting in `public/`.
- War report chart numbers: `src/data/war-report-charts.json` → `war-chart-data.ts` → `charts.ts`; `null` in JSON = unpublished (skip bar, not zero).
- War report PDF is a single 1920×14400 InDesign page.
- InDesign Package (IDML + Links + Document fonts) is the best local source for live Persian copy, named swatches, and original photos — not the full-page SVG (outlined glyphs, no `<text>`). Unpack `*.idml` (zip of XML). Annual landing: `گزارش_سال_خانومی/لندینگ گزارش سال Folder`. War: `گزارش_جنگ/گزارش جنگ Folder`. Do not put raw PSDs (e.g. Newspaper Mockup ~197MB) on the web; export compressed JPG/WebP. PIL can flatten packaged PSDs to JPEG.
- IDML Persian decimals often appear slash-reversed from RTL (`7/12%` → ۱۲٫۷٪, `5/1 میلیون` → ۱٫۵ میلیون). Reconstruct from adjacent year series, never copy the slash form.
- Two-report pixel dump: `/` annual PDF, `/war` war PDF. Raster slices in `public/assets/pixel`. Overlay hotspots for download, شروع مطالعه, war CTA, and icon nav. Artboard wrap must be `dir=ltr` + `origin-top-left` or RTL shifts the canvas off-screen.
- IDML button fills on the annual hero are Opacity 80 (`rgba(218, 25, 132, 0.8)`), not solid magenta.
- Annual landing type is IRANSans + IRANSansXFaNum (packaged TTFs), not Inter. Brand swatches: `Khanoumi 1 1404` CMYK 0/99/0/0; RGB Magenta copy `218 25 132` (`#DA1984`); site token remains Figma `#EC078D`.
- Preface (Story_u1643 / u1628): IRANSans 19/34 center; title Bold; body column 1342px; crop pad ~7px top / 43px bottom; 7 body lines at 1920. Title–body ink gap ~31px (`mt-5` after 34px leading), not a large `mb` on the heading. Keep IDML ZWNJ (`ادامه‌دادن`, `بلوغ‌ رسیدن`, `ظرفیت‌‌هایی`, `درجهت`). Year is ۱۴۰۴.
- Preface on the site starts collapsed (first paragraph only) with «خواندن بیشتر»; full four paragraphs only after expand. Button fill matches hero Opacity 80.
- Glance KPI icons are the six user SVGs (`hr-resources`, `females-managers`, `uniqe-employees`, `increased-sales`, `product-variations`, `brands`) recolored from `#FF03FF` to brand `#EC078D` in `public/assets/annual/glance/`.
- Glance sales pill must stay **one line** at every width (`whitespace-nowrap` + `clamp` type). Do not wrap at `sm:` 36px; that breakpoint is still too narrow.
- Glance KPI labels (esp. «نرخ رشد تعداد کالاهای فروخته‌شده:») also stay one line: `whitespace-nowrap` + `11px / sm:14px / lg:16px`. Do not use `leading-7` on those labels.
- Path (`#path`) year nodes use the user’s `circle.svg` / `arrow.svg` (circle recolored `#FF03FF` → `#EC078D`). Hover/focus fills the inner white with brand and the year turns white.
- Path section title sits in a brand `#EC078D` box (white type). Metric labels/notes under icons are black; percents stay pink and count up. Timeline is **LTR** (۱۴۰۲ left → ۱۴۰۴ right) with flipped arrows. Gender chart: text left, Chart.js bars right (`chart.js` + `react-chartjs-2`). Year ۱۴۰۴ sits centered **above** the bars; keep bars thin (`barThickness` 8) so they do not overflow the canvas.
- Path timeline (`#path ol`) stays **horizontal** at every width (`flex-row`, never `flex-col` below `lg`). Metric icons: `basket` حجم فروش · `loyal` وفاداری · `money` سودآوری · `chart` فروش. Gender: `inway` beside «در مسیر ساختن», `female` beside ۴۰٪ زن. Timeline has scroll-in stagger + arrow flow motion.
- Path metric percents: حجم فروش ۴۰٪ · وفاداری ۵۷٪ · سودآوری ۱۳۰٪ · فروش ۹۰+٪ (IDML frame positions + ۲×/۳٫۶× notes). Do not swap loyalty and sales.
- CSR (`#csr`): title in brand box with white hands-heart icon (`hands.svg` from PDF vector). Subtitle «زنان پیشگام ایران». RTL two-column: first = خانومی‌لایف (54-women book + مراقبت اجتماعی bar + 3 IG posts), second = خانومی بیزینس (می‌خواهم زیبا بمانم + گزارش ۲۰۲۵ خاورمیانه `2024-report.png` + گزارش مکنزی `mckinsey.svg`). Report tabs are **fixed rem** (`w-[5.75rem]` / `lg:w-[7rem]`, `h-[8.5rem]` / `sm:h-[9.5rem]` / `lg:h-[10.5rem]`), not `%` of the image — otherwise they look هم‌عرض on mobile and stick out on desktop. Tab height must clear the long «گزارش ۲۰۲۵ خاورمیانه» label. Cover images overlap the tab bottom (`-mt-[5.25rem]` / `sm:-mt-[6rem]` / `lg:-mt-[6.75rem]`) so the ribbon end sits behind the report art. Hero CTA uses `faBookOpen`, not a text ↓. Care tab stays in document flow. IG posts share `aspect-[9/16]` + `object-cover`. Do not start Users until csr is accepted.
- Users rings/fans are a local SVG engine in `src/charts/` (not Chart.js). Circles share a **bottom tangent** (`cy = anchorY - r`), plus a 4th inner disc for the people+crown mark **centered in that disc** (IDML Group_u1e60). Fan primitive is IDML `Polygon_u1ecf`: a **60° circular sector**; InDesign hides the vertex with a Paper clip. Fan labels sit on the SVG right edge (`text-anchor=start` + RTL), not on the wedges. No «دانلود SVG» in the report UI. Rings/fans stagger in on scroll (`users-in`). Insight copy stays **beside** the fan at all widths, with the three-tone people icon above it. Year labels must be LTR-isolated (`۱۴۰۴:` not bidi `۱۴:۰۴`). On narrow mobile columns, keep the fan's 220px internal geometry and scale the entire SVG with `max-width: 100%; height: auto`; recalculating it at the tiny column width crushes row spacing and overlaps labels. Use a smaller mobile `clipRatio`, a taller compact aspect, and `vertexGap: 34` so the smallest sector remains attached while label/percentage rows do not collide.
- Users golden-day (`روز طلایی`): black rounded card; balloon photo is packaged `enhanced_export copy 2.jpg` (not `campaign-555.jpg` planner mockup, not raw `555.psd`). Crop `BlackBeauty_FA_V01` / `black-beauty.png` to ink bounds or the 3D «بیوتی» looks tiny. IDML `5/1 میلیون` → ۱٫۵.
- Users time (`توسعه زمانی بازار`): live HTML, not a slice. Peak pill is `w-max` sitting on the pink-border card — `w-full` makes it look like a header bar. Headline pinks only **دوشنبه‌ها** and **جمعه‌ها**. Quiet dates ۱۴۰۳: ۱ فروردین | ۱۴۰۴: ۱۰ اسفند (Latin 1/10 in IDML → Persian). Newspaper is PDF-cropped WebP from `Newspaper Mockup copy.psd` (~197MB — never ship the PSD). Calendar+trend is a local SVG (up on peak, down inverted on the pink quiet box).
- Users geo (`تمرکز تقاضا`): local SVG donuts in `src/charts/DonutChart.ts` (not Chart.js). The two years stay side by side at every width in an LTR two-column grid (۱۴۰۳ left → ۱۴۰۴ right). On mobile each year is a vertical card with its two HTML labels below the ring; at `lg` labels move beside the ring. Clockwise from 12 o’clock: gray تهران then brand pink سایر (`#EC078D`). Ring SVG holds year only so labels never crush the hole. Year in the hole is LTR-isolated. IDML Latin years and `60٪` → ۱۴۰۳ / ۶۰٪.
- Products first band (`ترکیب انتخاب‌ها`): pink ExtraBold title + bottles SVG (not pink title box). Category chips: Figma SVG from file `uY7xhX77YskJ1Dnqat106E` card nodes (crop badge viewBox); brand recolor `#FF03FF`→`#EC078D`. Mini bars HTML/CSS (۱۴۰۲ light gray · ۱۴۰۳ dark gray · ۱۴۰۴ pink). Care hub pink circle + white line trend + `marks/care.svg` (`moraghebat`). Gold card single ۱٫۲۸٪ / ۱۴۰۴. Hub grid `dir=ltr`.
- Products skin-share charts are solid pies (not bars/donuts) and stay in one three-column row at every width. Use compact 9–10px mobile captions, brand `#EC078D` slices, and per-pie in-view stagger motion; keep all chart motion visible when `prefers-reduced-motion` disables animation.
- Products وزن‌بازار: follow the user pattern PNG (`weight-pattern.png` / Group_u2b54): dark→light pink fills by share, darker outer rim, icons **inside** the band (white on dark slices, pink on light), grey elbow leaders to spaced seats, **name then %** at tip, white year core. Year stays ۱۴۰۴ from report (not slash-decimals from IDML).
- CategoryCard badges sit above bar % labels (`pt-[3.75rem]` + fixed card height) so MarkDisc never covers chart numbers; gold card uses same fixed height as bar cards.
- Products category badges: export each Group card (`9:588` makeup … `9:688` gold) via `download_assets` SVG, save as `*-card.svg`, run `scripts/crop_product_badge_svgs.py`. Do not PDF-rasterize. Figma MCP Starter ~20 calls/month — batch small nodes; prefer new file `uY7xhX77YskJ1Dnqat106E` over exhausted `oe0nb1svy3Tn1BbpjnaYqC`.
- CSR replacement book mockups use `life-book-2026.png` / `biz-book-2026.png` in identical `aspect-[4/3]` frames with `object-cover`; reserve the frame so both cards stay equal across breakpoints.
- CategoryCard border must cross the badge center: article top padding equals half the badge diameter (`2.375rem` for 4.75rem; `sm:2.625rem` for 5.25rem). Activate the three-column category hub only at `xl`; at smaller widths use the two-column flow so 100% desktop zoom does not overflow.
- Users newspaper prefers packaged mockup `newspaper-mockup.png` (root `Newspaper-Mockup-copy.png`); calendar mark is `users/calendar.svg` (not FA).
- Annual SPA chrome: absolute (not sticky/fixed) top header overlays the hero only (logo + PDF + war) and scrolls away with the page; fixed bottom chapter dock (icons only). Thin progress bar stays fixed on top. Dock clearance lives in footer padding. Soft/dark «به‌زودی» slots only while a chapter is still locked. Section reveal with blur/scale; respect `prefers-reduced-motion`. Brand stays `#EC078D` / IRANSans — do not swap to Inter/Playfair/gold from ui-ux-pro-max. User rejected a flat “simple polish” pass — keep depth (glow, glass, gradient titles, orbit care hub) without inventing new report facts. Hero title stays moderate (`clamp` ~1.55–3.35rem), not oversized.
- War crisis callouts (`#crisis`): three equal HTML cards in one `grid-cols-3` row below SVG (never stacked, never `foreignObject`). SVG = curve + elbow bars to column centers; cards use real px type (14/12 mobile · 16/14 sm+).
- War resilience timeline (`#resilience`): geometry stays LTR so row icons/titles remain physically left, but every Persian date/title gets its own `dir=rtl`. Center the marker itself on the track and absolutely position its date above it; never vertically center the combined date+marker group. Marker positions and dashed lengths derive from exact Persian-date intervals with an inset track.
- Products pay/basket close the products chapter: BNPL pink gradient card (`wallet.svg`) + basket depth three cards (`bag.svg`). Partners (`#partners`): brand growth SVG line (LTR years), Beauty Ads glass + ROI panel (`adv.svg` / `roi.svg`), two ranked Iranian brand lists. Ops (`#ops`): waiting KPI circles + returns spark + ganje locker band + OTD bars + war CTA. After all annual frames are filled, footer drops «به‌زودی».

